Menace: AI Prank Photo & Video is using one of the strongest prank formats on TikTok right now: fake AI content turned into a text story.

One recent video reached 18.2M views.

The creator tells her dad that his 98-year-old mom is driving.

Then the video switches between the fake scenario and the text conversation, where the dad starts reacting in real time.

That reaction is the hook: “Parking my dad his 98 yr old mom is driving”.

This is the same structure we have already seen work across other AI prank accounts.

@wi.creates_: “Pranking my football obsessed bf I met ‘some guy on the plane'” · 6.3M views · App: CelebGen: Selfies with Celebs

@jacoblop27: “Le digo a mi jefe ha llegado el inspector de sanidad” · 1.9M views · App: Ploxto: AI Photo Editor

@dashapranks: “Pranking my mum my dad’s coffin fell out.. (Her replies 😳💀)” · 183K views · App: Halo: AI Photo Editor

@koen.ai runs a page teaching creators and entrepreneurs how to use AI and automations to produce content.

On his account, he has a video with 1.1M views and 12.8K comments.

