They all do videos like this with most being 2 to 5 minutes long. They use B-roll with text story overlays, either with a caption promoting the RIZZ app or a screenshot/name of the app inserted into the video.

They use various B-rolls from different games (not just Minecraft, but mostly Minecraft).

Check out the stats and engagement on those accounts for yourself. Some are still running full steam as of TODAY:

