But, the really crazy part is that if you scroll back to the beginning of those Astra and PlugAI accounts, they were originally promoting RIZZ:

So I tried digging deeper and found that Astra and PlugAI seem to be made by the same entity (even though they have different apple “developer” names):

Some of my guesses are:

1. They’re all made by the same developer (although RIZZ seems to be from a different one)

2. They’re buying those from some on-demand service (pay-per-video)

3. Those accounts are run by independent “creators” (hustlers)

4. Some combination of #1-3

